    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the shoes of an aspiring game developer and build your dream studio from scratch!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GameDev Clicker: Tap &amp; Build</strong> is a casual idle/clicker simulation where every tap helps you grow your game development empire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an idle clicker simulation game. You start alone in a small office and build a full team of developers over time. Tap to generate resources, automate your workflow, hire better devs, and release games to increase income.</p>",
